Error [E1296]: `--filter=billing...` is not a Jet workspace selector
 Why: D-JPK-SELECTOR1 rejects pnpm-style `--filter` pattern DSLs; Jet uses exact `-p <member>` and computed `--affected` / `--affected-since <ref>` instead.
 Fix: use `-p <member>` (repeatable) or `--affected` / `--affected-since <ref>`.
